; The unchanged normal journalctl --update-catalog reads only public catalog
; sources through /proc/self/fd and atomically replaces one database in the
; already-existing directory. fopen_temporary uses O_RDWR, not O_WRONLY.
; Source evidence is bound by native-journal-catalog-source.json and the
; external normal source readback; no R13 child AVC survived the audit loss.
